@startuml 04-seq-consent-and-authorization-start
title Consent creation and start of the OAuth2 authorization-code flow (steps 1-5)
autonumber
actor PSU
participant "PSU browser" as Br
participant "TPP A back end" as A
participant "Bank B XS2A API" as XS2A
participant "Bank B consent mgmt" as CM
participant "OIDC provider F" as F

PSU -> Br : select "Bank B", click Connect
Br -> A : POST /banks/B/connect
A -> XS2A : POST /v1/consents (mTLS QWAC)\naccess {accounts:[], balances:[]}, recurring, validUntil,\nTPP-Redirect-URI, PSU-IP-Address, X-Request-ID
XS2A -> XS2A : validate QWAC (AISP role), syntax, semantics
XS2A -> CM : create consent (received) + authorisation (received)
XS2A --> A : 201 consentId, ASPSP-SCA-Approach: REDIRECT\n_links: scaOAuth, scaStatus, self, status, confirmation
A -> F : GET /.well-known/oauth-authorization-server
F --> A : metadata (authorization_endpoint, token_endpoint, jwks_uri)
A -> A : generate state + PKCE verifier,\nbind to session and consentId
A --> Br : 302 F/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=PSDDE-BAFIN-123456\n&scope=AIS:{consentId} offline_access&state&redirect_uri\n&code_challenge&code_challenge_method=S256
Br -> F : GET /authorize
F -> F : validate client_id, redirect_uri, PKCE
F -> CM : consent {consentId} owned by client and status received?
CM --> F : yes
F --> Br : 302 Bank B CIAM /authorize (broker)\nacr_values=urn:bank-b:psd2:sca, consent context
@enduml
